  "user_request_original": "Perform coherent TMM optimization for a 12-layer planar dielectric stack on Ge substrate with air incidence at normal angle. Layer sequence: ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe (12 finite layers total). Initialize thicknesses from vector [417, 455, 500, 696, 850, 850, 553, 510, 593, 501, 417, 455] nm (peak candidate from iteration_11 with 1000nm layers capped to 850nm). Bound all thicknesses to 100-850nm range. Optimize for high transmittance in 8000-11000nm band and low transmittance in 3000-5000nm band. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with learning rate step multiplier reduced by 40% from default. Wavelength sweep: 3000-11000nm with dense sampling in both target bands. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 8000-11000 nm, 3000-5000 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 8000-11000 nm band; Low transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: High transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count not exceeding 16.",
